      "id": 1,
      "text": "Dixon was named after its founder, Dickinson, whose surname was shortened to 'Dick‑son' when he established the town's first hotel, store, and post office in 1854.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        1,
        30
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2",
